{"id":"msg_m_subquest_1023_s","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_collector","label":"Collector · Quest"},"label":"5. Commander.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_subquest_1022_e","next":"msg_m_subquest_1023_e","speakers":{"collector":"Collector"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_1","text":"Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_2","text":"Are you safe?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_3","text":"If you are, please reply.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_4","text":"I'm safe and sound.","jump":"m_subquest_1023_s_6"},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_5","text":"Life has been tough lately.","jump":"m_subquest_1023_s_7"},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_6","text":"Thanks goodness.","jump":"m_subquest_1023_s_8"},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_7","text":"Oh, er... well, at least you're alive.","jump":"m_subquest_1023_s_8"},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_8","text":"It's pandemonium over in the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_9","text":"I didn't know if anything had happened to you, so I wanted to send a message.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_10","text":"How are you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_11","text":"Still alive and kicking,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_12","text":"but the Outer Rim is in shambles.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_13","text":"Normally, a Rapture attack on the Ark","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_14","text":"would be of no concern to us,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_15","text":"as there was the Partition separating us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_16","text":"However, it suddenly opened up!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_17","text":"As if it had a mind of its own.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_18","text":"I don't have a clue who opened it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_19","text":"but as a result, Raptures have been swarming into the Outer Rim.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_20","text":"Everyone's running for their lives.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_21","text":"I'll be right over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_22","text":"Nah, don't inconvenience yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_23","text":"We're all well-versed in evading Raptures,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_24","text":"so we'll be able to stay hidden no problem. Don't worry about us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_25","text":"Then how can I help?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_26","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_27","text":"I didn't want to mention it right away. Don't want to appear materialistic,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_28","text":"but since you asked...","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_29","text":"Go on.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_30","text":"When the Partition opened up,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_31","text":"a few of my friends stormed outside.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_32","text":"They said rather than dying here,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_33","text":"they wanted to see what it was like","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_34","text":"to step inside the Ark before they died.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_35","text":"Communications were spotty, but functional, for a while,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_36","text":"but now they're completely down.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_37","text":"If you could confirm what happened to them,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_38","text":"I'd be eternally grateful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_39","text":"Okay, I'll go look for them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_40","text":"Thank you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1023_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"collector","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1023_s_41","text":"truly.","jump":null}],"chat":true}